    },
    {
      "block_id": 9,
      "type": 0,
      "text": "STATE 19 \nOn the falling edge of the clock entering S19, the processor negates AS, \nUOS, and [OS. As the clock rises at the end of S19, the processor \n",
      "bbox": [
        48.959999084472656,
        272.1600036621094,
        435.3863220214844,
        297.04901123046875
      ],
      "bbox_norm": [
        0.09714285532633464,
        0.41937868966846276,
        0.8638617500426278,
        0.4577308326752134
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_id": 10,
      "type": 0,
      "text": "places the address and data buses in the high-impedance state, and drives \nR/W high. The device negates DTACK or BERA at this time. \n",
      "bbox": [
        107.2199935913086,
        294.72003173828125,
        434.3147888183594,
        319.1904296875
      ],
      "bbox_norm": [
